  </div>

  <div class="overview-bar">
    <div style="position: relative; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.7%; width: 100%; border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e8e8; padding-bottom: 20px;">
      <div class="meta">
        <div>Instructor: Jinmo Rhee</div>
        <div>Scripting &amp; Parametric Design &nbsp;|&nbsp; (MSSD) Carnegie Mellon University &nbsp;|&nbsp; 2022</div>
        <div>Tools: Rhino, Grasshopper, &amp; Gh Python</div>
        <div>Type of Work: Teamwork with Sanjana Nagaraj</div>
      </div>
      <a href="#content" class="scroll-cue" aria-label="Scroll down">
